{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-220":{"renderings":[{"id":"777b6b38d0d9b2b3","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Indicates something is unbearable or not worth doing (e.g., 'unbearable to watch', 'unbearable to listen to')."},{"id":"cc69de84427f3a35","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The ～に堪えない grammar pattern is used when something is so unpleasant, awful, or painful that one cannot tolerate it. Common verbs include 見るに堪えない, 聞くに堪えない, 読むに堪えない, etc., meaning 'unbearable to see/hear/read.'"},{"id":"1068d0f8e91b82c3","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Verb-dictionary form + に堪えない, Noun + に堪えない"},{"id":"33fa533e40afbdab","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"に堪えない: unbearable to, or too much to (見るに堪えない)."},{"id":"2e4e09ff35069847","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"worth"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Worth (Worth Doing / In Vain / Bearable)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"worth"}}]},"n1-220#9e8de8c306d0":{"renderings":[{"id":"b616f5e072d3c2fb","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"His jokes are unbearable to listen to."}]},"n1-220#3c2ed0c8d319":{"renderings":[{"id":"7e6bcc75c55c10c3","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"That movie is so bad that it’s unbearable to watch."}]},"n1-220#b4041cb77e73":{"renderings":[{"id":"5d380f7020912d3b","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"This novel is so boring that it’s unbearable to read."}]},"n1-220#38db698e58db":{"renderings":[{"id":"615e2d0a3fc38356","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-220"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"His behavior is unbearable to watch."}]}}}